  "worked_solution": "A hot dog costs $H$ dollars, one medium fries costs $F$ dollars, and a medium soft drink costs $D$ dollars. Thus, the cost, in dollars, of a combo is\n\n$$\n4H+2F+2D.\n$$\n\nAlan's bill, in dollars, comes to\n\n$$\n5(4H+2F+2D).\n$$\n\nHence, the factor $5$ must be the total number of combos that he's purchased.",
